      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://villageofmorganza.com/about-us",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Morganza hosted a major Union Army encampment that captured nearly 600 troops.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.morganzala.com/historic-sites",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1968 film Easy Rider shot a scene in Morganza, leaving a marker where the café once stood.",
